<title>POLAND: KPW CLEARS NEW ISSUE OF POLISH BUDIMEX POZNAN.</title>
<headline>KPW CLEARS NEW ISSUE OF POLISH BUDIMEX POZNAN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Securities Commission</p>
<p>(KPW) on Thursday cleared for public trade 8.7 million shares</p>
<p>of construction company Budimex Poznan SA, the KPW said in a</p>
<p>statement.</p>
<p>It said that the approved shares included between two and</p>
<p>4,053,500 shares offered in public subscription.</p>
<p> Tranches		  No Of Shares	   Subscription</p>
<p>			     Offered		  Period</p>
<p> Employees		 2,000,000		18-28.08.97</p>
<p> Investors		 2,053,500		26.08-2.09.97</p>
<p>Note: The company seeks a parallell market listing.</p>
<p>EARNINGS DATA	    1996   1995</p>
<p>(in mln of PLN)</p>
<p> Net profit:	     2.26   0.54</p>
<p> Sales:		  104.97  56.49</p>
<p>Main Shareholders:</p>
<p> Budimex SA - 77.02 pct of shares</p>
<p> The City of Poznan    - 18.39 pct of shares</p>
<p> No of existing shares: 4,646,500</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
